2026-07-27T09:19:40.0829572Z i /tmp/Rtmpk8zIP9/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:19:40.0829964Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:19:40.0830421Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:19:40.0830814Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:19:40.0831435Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:19:40.0832348Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:19:40.0833369Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
